          "payer_stage_convention_note": "MDIndia convention: sequential authorisations are issued as separate letters with explicit cancellation language. The latest letter REPLACES all prior — i.e. total = latest_letter_amount (NOT cumulative_max, NOT incremental_sum). Observationally compatible with cumulative_max when stage 2 > stage 1, but semantically distinct (cancellation, not aggregation). The functional outcome on this case is indistinguishable from cumulative_max since we don't have the prior letter to compare against — but the explicit cancellation language is the diagnostic.",
